    /// PascalCase variants like `<H1>` are assumed to be custom components and are ignored.
    /// :::
    ///
    /// ## Examples
    ///
    /// ### Invalid
    ///
    /// ```html,expect_diagnostic
    /// <h1></h1>
    /// ```
    ///
    /// ```html,expect_diagnostic
    /// <h1>   </h1>
    /// ```
    ///
    /// ```html,expect_diagnostic
    /// <h1 aria-hidden="true">content</h1>
    /// ```
